      "snippet": "Whisper Large V3 Turbo is an optimized version of OpenAI&#x27;s Whisper Large V3 speech recognition model, designed for high-speed and cost-efficient transcription. It supports 99+ languages and accepts common audio formats including mp3, mp4, wav, webm, flac, and ogg."
