    {
      "title": "`turbo` model release · openai whisper · Discussion #2363",
      "url": "https://github.com/openai/whisper/discussions/2363",
      "snippet": "We&#x27;re releasing a new Whisper model named large-v3-turbo, or turbo for short. It is an optimized version of Whisper large-v3 and has only 4 decoder layers—just like the tiny model—down from the 32 in the large series. This work is inspired by Distil-Whisper [1], where the authors observed that using a smaller decoder can greatly improve transcription speed while causing minimal ..."
